        <activityName xml:lang="en">Uranium underground mine</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Uranium underground mine
This infrastructure module is based on the definition given in the US DOE reference for a model mine representing US conditions: U3O8 grade 0.2%;
UUID: cbd111cd-1d58-30be-af52-a6a0cdb5967a
This module includes the material requirements for the entire lifetime of the mine. Also the transport of these materials and the land use of the mine are included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average conditions in early 1980s.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cbd111cd-1d58-30be-af52-a6a0cdb5967a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
